Ye [D]waado ka hai [G]kya,        Aaj [A]hai kal na [D]hi
[D]Jaane kyu yeh [G]pal,        Pighal ga [A]ya, fisal ga [D]ya
[D]Jaane kyu yeh [G]pal,        Pighal ga [A]ya, pighal ga [D]ya
Tu bhi [G]hai main bhi [D]hu,        Pyaar [G]bhi hai ya [A]ha
